OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos warning after fire on    
OL,4,Aindustrial estate                      
OL,6,FFire crews have warned people living   
OL,7,Fnear an industrial estate to keep their
OL,8,Fwindows and doors closed following a   
OL,9,Ffire in a building that may have       
OL,10,Fcontained toxic materials.             
OL,12,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,13,Fto reports of a blaze at the site on   
OL,14,FDouglas Road in Kingswood, on the edge 
OL,15,Fof Bristol, in the early hours.        
OL,17,FThe flames were extinguished just after
OL,18,F09:00 GMT but a fire service           
OL,19,Fspokesperson said there was a risk of  
OL,20,F"small pockets of smoke" being released
OL,21,Fwhile the blaze was dampened down.     
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
