OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos warning after fire on    
OL,4,Aindustrial estate                      
OL,6,F"We advise local residents on Douglas  
OL,7,FRoad and neighbouring roads to not     
OL,8,Ftouch any debris that may have resulted
OL,9,Ffrom the fire as it may contain harmful
OL,10,Fmaterials such as asbestos," they      
OL,11,Fadded.                                 
